{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0051722 protein C-terminal methylesterase activity\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/27558\n\nShould be replaced by parent GO:0051723 protein methylesterase activity\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1YWfjXVf_yP9IEy-fz8df6-pzCMjbMhAmKgVj6P7FTck/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nUniProt 1\nSGD 1\nHGNC-UCL 1 - done\n\n--\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-06-02T17:41:30Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0051722 protein C-terminal methylesterase activity", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-06-20T16:08:20Z"}
